 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "Paginator(totalPages, visibleCount, currentPage) stores the state. next() and prev() move the current page by one, and goTo(page) jumps to page; every move clamps the page into [1, totalPages] and returns the rendered string for the new state. The static render(totalPages, visibleCount, currentPage) shows a window of v = min(visibleCount, totalPages) consecutive pages: its start is currentPage - floor((visibleCount - 1) / 2), clamped into [1, totalPages - v + 1]. Tokens, separated by single spaces: \"<\" when currentPage > 1, \"...\" when the window starts after page 1, each page number with the current one written as \"[p]\", \"...\" when the window ends before totalPages, and \">\" when currentPage < totalPages.",
  "provenance": [
   {
    "repository": "gamma",
    "revision": null,
    "path": "projects/algorithm_solver/catalogue/authored/hack2hire-chunk10-b-20261028-v1/contracts.json",
    "sha256": "0829f1b98e3a4aa7bfc32413e21359791d60ea7c8efe9cf209942feec47b0ca8",
    "selector": "/problems/9/inferred_spec"
   }
  ]
 },
